The following files were copied from ndlocr-lite without modification
(other than the addition of this attribution comment):

  deim.py          ← src/deim.py
  parseq.py        ← src/parseq.py
  ndl_parser.py    ← src/ndl_parser.py
  reading_order/utils/logger.py    ← src/reading_order/utils/logger.py
  reading_order/utils/time.py      ← src/reading_order/utils/time.py
  reading_order/utils/xml.py       ← src/reading_order/utils/xml.py
  config/NDLmoji.yaml              ← src/config/NDLmoji.yaml
  config/ndl.yaml                  ← src/config/ndl.yaml
  model/*.onnx                     ← src/model/*.onnx

The following files are derived from ndlocr-lite sources and have been
modified.  Each file carries a header comment identifying the original
source and describing the nature of the modifications:

  reading_order/xy_cut/block_xy_cut.py  ← src/reading_order/xy_cut/block_xy_cut.py
    Modified: converted absolute imports to relative imports.

  reading_order/xy_cut/eval.py          ← src/reading_order/xy_cut/eval.py
    Modified: converted absolute imports to relative imports;
              simplified to the eval_xml entry point only.

  reading_order/order/reorder.py        ← src/reading_order/order/reorder.py
    Modified: converted absolute imports to relative imports.

  reading_order/order/smooth_order.py   ← src/reading_order/order/smooth_order.py
    Modified: converted absolute imports to relative imports.

  reading_order/order/warichu_block.py  ← src/reading_order/order/warichu_block.py
    Modified: converted absolute imports to relative imports.

The following file is newly written for this project but incorporates
logic derived from ndlocr-lite/src/ocr.py:

  engine.py
    Derived from: src/ocr.py
    Modifications: restructured as a reusable Python class (OCREngine);
                   removed CLI argument parsing and file I/O;
                   added lazy model loading and progress callbacks.

